('dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd','https://www.hiddencitysecrets.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Carlton-Club-Function-Venues-Melbourne-Venue-Hire-CBD-Rooms-Rooftop-Event-Spaces-Birthday-Party-Corporate-Room-Unique-001.jpg','The Carlton Club',350,'Melbourne CBD',120,'The venue spans across multiple levels, each with its own energy and decor. Featuring a range of unique indoor and outdoor function spaces, it’s perfect for intimate booth dinners, rooftop takeovers or club nights for up to 300 guests.'),

('dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd','https://www.hiddencitysecrets.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/glasshaus-function-venues-melbourne-venue-hire-cocktail-party-functions-warehouse-rooms-private-room-open-spaces-event-space-corporate-events-small-012.jpg','Glasshaus',180,'Richmond',110,'A bright and modern venue surrounded by parklands, offering floor-to-ceiling windows and natural light.'),

('dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd','https://www.hiddencitysecrets.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/death-or-glory-restaurant-restaurants-pub-pubs-diner-eats-food-drinks-prahran-melbourne-14.jpg','Death or Glory',150,'Prahran',95,'Death or Glory is a Bar & Restaurant located in the bustle of Chapel St in Prahran. With a killer menu, trivia and comedy nights and a wide range of food and drink, your whole week is literally sorted.'),

('eeeeeeee-eeee-eeee-eeee-eeeeeeeeeeee','https://www.hiddencitysecrets.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Blossom-Rooftop-Bar-Function-Venues-Melbourne-Venue-Hire-CBD-Rooms-Birthday-Party-City-View-Engagement-Wedding-Corporate-13.jpg','Blossom Rooftop Bar',250,'Melbourne CBD',130,'A rooftop venue with stunning city skyline views and a luxurious contemporary atmosphere.'),

('eeeeeeee-eeee-eeee-eeee-eeeeeeeeeeee','https://www.hiddencitysecrets.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/The-Tippler-Co-Restaurant-East-Melbourne-Restaurants-Private-Group-Share-Dinning-Top-Best-Good-Casual-Outdoor-Cool-Tapas-011.jpg','The Tippler & Co',140,'East Melbourne',100,'Located only a stone’s throw from the MCG, The Tippler & Co is a lush plant-filled bar and eatery that has been built on a passion for good hospitality, food and drink.'),

